abstract: >-
  A reproducible research framework for virtual high-grade IMU learning,
  recording-aware public-dataset preparation, classical and neural baseline
  comparison, cross-domain evaluation, and indexed scientific reporting.
keywords:
  - IMU
  - virtual sensor
  - inertial navigation
  - sensor calibration
  - time-series learning
  - reproducibility
